(REMOVED: TESTING_AND_WORKFLOW) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- test_001 ? How are IPPL unit tests organized and what do they parameterize over?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The core idea of V2 was to keep only questions that should be answerable from IPPL src/ code or ) Tj
T*
(repository documentation, and to drop questions whose best evidence lived in tests, mini-apps, or ) Tj
T*
(example files outside that scope.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHAT WE WORKED ON BETWEEN THE TWO EVALUATIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LOCATION AND LIFECYCLE QUESTIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We worked on failures like ?Where is Kokkos initialized and finalized inside IPPL?? and related ) Tj
T*
(exact-location questions. The main change was to stop relying purely on semantic similarity and ) Tj
T*
(instead rescue exact API call sites directly.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ALGORITHM-SPECIFIC SOLVER QUESTIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We focused on questions like the FFT-based periodic/open-boundary Poisson solver prompts, where ) Tj
T*
(retrieval was drifting into generic FFT infrastructure instead of solver implementations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(DATA-FLOW QUESTIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We spent time on grid-to-particle and particle-to-grid handoff questions. The main theme was that ) Tj
T*
(these require cross-module evidence rather than more chunks from a single solver file.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(COMPARISON QUESTIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We worked specifically on the FFT-vs-CG Poisson comparison case to make retrieval cover both solver ) Tj
T*
(families instead of flooding the prompt with FFT-only material.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PROMPT HYGIENE FOR SUPPLEMENTARY CONTEXT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We tightened how supplementary symbol-level chunks are rendered so they contribute only the most ) Tj
T*
(relevant support facts and a small code snippet, rather than a full second explanation block.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(IMPLEMENTATION CHANGES) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The most relevant changes between the two evaluations were:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- 0db9dba ? Created eval_job.sh so the evaluation can run non-interactively on gwendolen and write ) Tj
T*
(answer files under docs/evaluations/answers.) Tj
T*
(- 31a61e5 ? Improved lifecycle/location retrieval by detecting location intent, synthesizing exact ) Tj
T*
(API-bearing terms such as Kokkos::initialize, injecting literal matches, and boosting those exact ) Tj
T*
(call sites in reranking.) Tj
T*
(- cb0b888 ? Added comparison-aware retrieval for Poisson-solver tradeoff questions so the system ) Tj
T*
(retrieves both sides of the comparison instead of collapsing onto generic FFT infrastructure.) Tj
T*
(- 5511d34 ? Created the V2 evaluation question set and updated eval_job.sh so SSH runs use the ) Tj
T*
(filtered V2 questions and write V2-labelled answer files.) Tj
T*
(- 2e51a05 ? Shortened the content of supplementary symbol-entity chunks sent to the answering LLM so) Tj
T*
( secondary context acts like support evidence rather than noisy full chunks.) Tj
T*
(- c07cd94 ? Added an eval-job-specific answer-model override mechanism so the cluster evaluation can) Tj
T*
( use a different answer model without changing the normal local runtime settings.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CATEGORY-BY-CATEGORY COMPARISON) Tj
T*
